# Documentaries desk — midnight stage + free voice preview

## Stage color (never cream on Script / Shots)

- `.film-stage` for **topic, script, cast** stays **midnight** `#150f23` with light text (`#fffdf8` / `#efe8fb` / `#cfc8d6`).
- Empty states (`.film-stage-empty` h2/p) must stay **light** on midnight — never `#150f23` / `#2f283d` (black-on-black).
- Do **not** restyle Script or Generate footage (Shots) to cream `#fffdf8` / `#f7f5f0` with dark headings.
- Film step rail: cream bar on the workbench (`#fffdf8`). Short centered title pills (`flex` + `width: auto`) — never `grid` / `repeat(4, 1fr)` stretch, never tall sticker cards. Inactive `#150f23`; active lime `#c2ef4e`.
- Stage body under the rail stays midnight `#150f23` with light copy (never cream stage + faint headings).
- Keep nav title **Generate footage** for step 03.

## Voice preview (0 credits)

- Audition uses vendor **`preview_url`** from `GET /api/audio/voices` (prefer ElevenLabs `category=premade`).
- **Never** call TTS / `POST /api/audio/tts` / assemble enqueue just to preview a voice.
- UI must expose an explicit **Play / Stop** control next to the narration voice select.
- Hint copy: Play = free demo; Assemble = when narration is generated (credits).

## Shot engine labels

- Candidate chips use `DOC_SHOT_MODELS` (Seedance / Kling / LTX / …) as display labels — not Pexels photographer names.
